// customers.malloy
//
// Fully visible model — control case. Workspace and package pages should
// render it as a normal, clickable model row.
##! m4warnings

#(doc) Customer dimension with region and signup date.
source: customers is duckdb.table('data/customers.csv') extend {
  primary_key: customer_id

  dimension:
    name is name
    region is region
    signed_up is signed_up::date
}
